From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia.pukngae@linux.dev>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:54:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: Propagate HIF power-up failure to system resume

The ordinary resume callback waits for firmware restart completion even
when resume_early() failed to power up the HIF. The firmware cannot
signal completion in this case. Preserve the HIF error and return it
from the ordinary resume callback without waiting for the reset timeout.

Reset the saved error at the beginning of suspend so an aborted later
cycle cannot report a stale failure. Keep waiting for firmware after a
successful HIF start.

Codex wrote the change and checked successful restart, HIF error,
missing completion and suspend cancellation with source-based tests.

Fixes: 8d5f4da8d70b ("wifi: ath12k: support suspend/resume")
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia.pukngae@linux.dev>
---
 drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.c | 7 +++++++
 drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.h | 1 +
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.c b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.c
index 97b42e6..ab2ea99 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.c
@@ -126,6 +126,8 @@ int ath12k_core_suspend(struct ath12k_base *ab)
 	struct ath12k *ar;
 	int ret, i;
 
+	ab->resume_early_error = 0;
+
 	ret = ath12k_core_continue_suspend_resume(ab);
 	if (ret <= 0)
 		return ret;
@@ -193,6 +195,7 @@ int ath12k_core_resume_early(struct ath12k_base *ab)
 
 	reinit_completion(&ab->restart_completed);
 	ret = ath12k_hif_power_up(ab);
+	ab->resume_early_error = ret;
 	if (ret)
 		ath12k_warn(ab, "failed to power up hif during resume: %d\n", ret);
 
@@ -205,6 +208,10 @@ int ath12k_core_resume(struct ath12k_base *ab)
 	long time_left;
 	int ret;
 
+	/* No firmware restart can complete when powering up the HIF failed. */
+	if (ab->resume_early_error)
+		return ab->resume_early_error;
+
 	ret = ath12k_core_continue_suspend_resume(ab);
 	if (ret <= 0)
 		return ret;
diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.h b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.h
index 674f7e7..27c071b 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.h
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/core.h
@@ -1112,6 +1112,7 @@ struct ath12k_base {
 	} fw;
 
 	struct completion restart_completed;
+	int resume_early_error;
 
 #ifdef CONFIG_ACPI
 
-- 
2.55.0

